        "Natural Paper (CIE 80–90, slightly warm)"@en,
        "Papel Natural (CIE 80–90, ligeramente cálido)"@es,
        "नैचुरल काग़ज़ (CIE 80–90, हल्का गर्म)"@hi,
        "ナチュラル紙（CIE 80〜90、やや温かみ）"@ja,
        "Naturlig papir (CIE 80–90, lett varm)"@nb,
        "Naturelpapier (CIE 80–90, licht warm)"@nl,
        "Papier naturalny (CIE 80–90, lekko ciepły)"@pl,
        "Papel natural (CIE 80–90, levemente quente)"@pt,
        "Naturpapper (CIE 80–90, lätt varm)"@sv,
        "自然色纸 (CIE 80–90，微暖)"@zh-Hans ;
